    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You love 4X games but are short on time? We got you!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready Commander! <i>Rules of War</i> delivers all the army building, research, diplomacy, and missile strikes in under an hour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/6cd9e3440cd012d84fc3710426b0c01e.poster.avif?t=1752899009\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/6cd9e3440cd012d84fc3710426b0c01e.webm?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/6cd9e3440cd012d84fc3710426b0c01e.mp4?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the leader of a once powerful nuclear-armed nation that is falling apart. Can you keep the nation together? Can you find allies and uncover your enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/9a04bef7d244b561cff9be5efb087875.poster.avif?t=1752899009\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/9a04bef7d244b561cff9be5efb087875.webm?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/9a04bef7d244b561cff9be5efb087875.mp4?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With accessible mechanics and an exciting campaign, <i>Rules of War</i> brings<strong> strategy, modern warfare, and decision making</strong> into one fast-paced experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/cb6f1cb28f8d163c71a4e9da6ba2484c.poster.avif?t=1752899009\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/cb6f1cb28f8d163c71a4e9da6ba2484c.webm?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/cb6f1cb28f8d163c71a4e9da6ba2484c.mp4?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the kind of leader who survives? Or starts the next war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck Commander. \u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You love 4X games but are short on time? We got you!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready Commander! <i>Rules of War</i> delivers all the army building, research, diplomacy, and missile strikes in under an hour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/6cd9e3440cd012d84fc3710426b0c01e.poster.avif?t=1752899009\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/6cd9e3440cd012d84fc3710426b0c01e.webm?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/6cd9e3440cd012d84fc3710426b0c01e.mp4?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the leader of a once powerful nuclear-armed nation that is falling apart. Can you keep the nation together? Can you find allies and uncover your enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/9a04bef7d244b561cff9be5efb087875.poster.avif?t=1752899009\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/9a04bef7d244b561cff9be5efb087875.webm?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/9a04bef7d244b561cff9be5efb087875.mp4?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With accessible mechanics and an exciting campaign, <i>Rules of War</i> brings<strong> strategy, modern warfare, and decision making</strong> into one fast-paced experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/cb6f1cb28f8d163c71a4e9da6ba2484c.poster.avif?t=1752899009\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/cb6f1cb28f8d163c71a4e9da6ba2484c.webm?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957600/extras/cb6f1cb28f8d163c71a4e9da6ba2484c.mp4?t=1752899009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the kind of leader who survives? Or starts the next war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck Commander. \u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Take command in this 4X-lite strategy game with fast-paced tactical combat and missile warfare. Build your economy, deploy land, sea, and air units, expand borders, advance technology, and navigate deceitful diplomacy. In a world of collapsing nuclear powers, can you lead your nation to victory?",
